title: Dell PowerVault ME5: Schedules
agents: dell_powervault_me5
catalog: hw/storagehw/dell
license: GPLv2
distribution: Sher Zaman
description:
 Monitors schedules on a Dell PowerVault ME5 system that are not tied to a
 specific volume, for example a replication schedule. Reports the schedule
 status, the time of the last run, the next scheduled run and any error the
 array reports.

 Schedules that create snapshots for a volume are not shown here; they are
 reported by that volume's service in the "Dell PowerVault ME5: Snapshots"
 check, so snapshot protection is visible in one place.

 A next run time that has already passed maps to OK by default; set the overdue
 state to Warning or Critical to alert on a stalled schedule. Conditions are
 configurable via the "Dell PowerVault ME5 schedule" ruleset.

item:
 The schedule name as reported by the array.

discovery:
 One service is created per schedule that does not map to a volume. Arrays
 without such schedules get no services.
